{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:59 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5cfcdd63a9b8abdecc58de2c0b95ff8c/2026-10/666_7.jpg\"/>\n<p>今（29日）午2時16分，黃大仙道近馬仔坑道有水管爆裂，黃大仙上邨全邨包括商場位置，因水務署需維修食水管，暫停食水供應。署方已調派水車至啟善樓、達善樓及倡善樓對開，目前有約50至60人排隊取水。水務署網頁指出，預計明日凌晨3時恢復供水。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃大仙道近馬仔坑道有水管爆裂。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10adcfd6b433c608f02c010bc058b152/2026-10/11_1_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃大仙道近馬仔坑道有水管爆裂。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d711c01da54cfc7628b3a16e878b3aaa/2026-10/01_1_41.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署派水車救急。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ca0005f4bff798ea0dbcba767c917fa/2026-10/12_37.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署派水車救急。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3772d6133999bc5e56a93556892d4a5/2026-10/13_0_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署派水車救急。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1d116570610df4fb1d343aafb6cf640/2026-10/14_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署派水車救急。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15c50793be5b9f0880c8bfd0eb1f82be/2026-10/02_48.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"工人搶修爆裂水管。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e1ab012fd7100676db8871f6ab0127b/2026-10/03_1_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃大仙道近馬仔坑道有水管爆裂。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42c3864c533d60692ad6e7dd7696d427/2026-10/04_7_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署派水車救急。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d00d4b1ab978517ee62ff7d1ea943e12/2026-10/05_1_30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署派水車救急。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3f95647d3a8251664122a2c87bab627/2026-10/06_0_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方封鎖一段路面搶修。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f265fb1913176988b3af46c7cf64c543/2026-10/07_2_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃大仙上邨停水。　\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/625fc646aa0532b9f029762c480ee60a/2026-10/31_0_41.jpg\"/>\n<p>運輸署表示，因水管爆裂，黃大仙道(來回方向)介乎馬仔坑道與雅竹街之間的全線仍然封閉。以下巴士路線須改道行駛：九巴7M、11C及211線；城巴A23線。有關個別巴士路線的最新服務情況，市民可參閱巴士公司的網頁或流動應用程式內的資訊。駕駛人士請考慮使用其他道路。現時上址交通繁忙。</p>\n<img alt=\"工人在場搶修。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29048da152c8f168919c829aa007d6f7/2026-10/01_1_43.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"工人在場搶修。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8872f39f202b9dc0cb42d099175b26b4/2026-10/02_50.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水務署搬來巨型水缸應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7aff94f51476bd458be49accf1542c00/2026-10/03_1_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"市民到水車取水應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4cc5d2eca8d39bcee131442952334df/2026-10/04_7_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"市民到水車取水應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e91ec672aa229135ecd94c04aaea1ec5/2026-10/05_1_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"市民到水車取水應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d68cce7acc25ae1b1d0b9aeb0b3580cc/2026-10/06_0_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"市民到水車取水應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b48f6dd3bb2741acc493bb1f979a703a/2026-10/07_2_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場還在搶修。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1cd129409ad61d9e6c4b5f2b80f9b17f/2026-10/08_0_21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批市民落樓取水應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f494fe03d56e9876bfde09a1e45e599f/2026-10/09_0_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批市民落樓取水應急。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dddcb6fc62678f2fbd6a4dd77d977b4/2026-10/11_0_48.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:35.683698+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:59:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:38.533502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:38.533502+00:00","content_hash":"57881113cb6adce4053768a48360b4999431763cafe0eab56b1dd3596aadfa4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}